Source: dragomand-models-all
Section: localization
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Blagovest Petrov <blagovest@petrovs.info>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://dragomand.l10n-bg.dev
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/VuteTech/dragomand
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/VuteTech/dragomand.git
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: dragomand-models-all
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dragomand,
@DEPENDS@
Description: all translation models for dragomand (metapackage)
 Installs every dragomand model package: offline machine translation
 between English and each of @COUNT@ languages, from Mozilla's Firefox
 Translations. The models take roughly @SIZE@ of disk space.
